{
  "entries": [
    {
      "offset": "0x20ed25",
      "back_en": "Ghhhh...!!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Onomatopoeia identical."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20eda0",
      "back_en": "Ah... Ahhh!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Identical."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20edfc",
      "back_en": "How dare you ask me to abandon my homeland!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'pedir' (ask) vs 'tell' minor, sense preserved."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20ee26",
      "back_en": "My owlo, please! You must understand!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20ef36",
      "back_en": "This is not a retreat...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20ef4f",
      "back_en": "We are merely shifting course!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20ef80",
      "back_en": "We shall return here one day!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20ef9e",
      "back_en": "Those who yet live, rise and escort our owlo!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Archaic imperative matches tone."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20f026",
      "back_en": "...Entua.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Identical."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20f0bc",
      "back_en": "Bow, prostrate, and crawl, but live...",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'rastejam' should be imperative 'rastejem' for consistency."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20f29e",
      "back_en": "I understand now why there was no pursuit.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20f2c9",
      "back_en": "The old man's favorite lapdog came for me.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20f2f8",
      "back_en": "The Imperial Guard of the Right, Oshtor!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20f3c8",
      "back_en": "You dare think you can stand in my way!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20f47b",
      "back_en": "Very well, Oshtor. But I warn you now;",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20f4a4",
      "back_en": "my head will not be so easily taken.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20f534",
      "back_en": "Oh? So you would obstruct my path as well?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20f55f",
      "back_en": "No, my owlo. I ask your permission.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20f595",
      "back_en": "I ask that you allow me to handle this.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20f5bd",
      "back_en": "I wish to confront this bearer of the mask to",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'enfrentar' (confront) weakens 'slay' (matar/abater)."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20f63e",
      "back_en": "I see... Martyrdom, is it?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20f659",
      "back_en": "Old fool... You may do as you please.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20f749",
      "back_en": "Oshtor's head will be worth one thousand",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20f7ba",
      "back_en": "You would sacrifice your own life so that",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20f7e7",
      "back_en": "Gundhurua escape... I commend your valor.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20f823",
      "back_en": "Then I shall honor your resolve...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20f8b2",
      "back_en": "These masked generals are nothing short of",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20f9ae",
      "back_en": "I accept.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20f9b8",
      "back_en": "Hm... So you will not use that accursed mask",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20fa55",
      "back_en": "Then let your arrogance be your downfall!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20faf5",
      "back_en": "...That... crest on the flag...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20fb15",
      "back_en": "Father!!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20fc7f",
      "back_en": "stands, defying the pain coursing through him.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20fcd9",
      "back_en": "destroyed... I shall not let you pass!!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20fdda",
      "back_en": "despair to my liege, and suffering to my people.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20fe0b",
      "back_en": "Lord Zeguni, come at me with all your might!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20fe59",
      "back_en": "Let this end our duel!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20fe70",
      "back_en": "Very well. Then taste the power of my final",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'poder' for 'might' fine."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20fe9e",
      "back_en": "strike... for I shall put my own life into it",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2100cf",
      "back_en": "of the Imperial Guard of the Right...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2100f2",
      "back_en": "Your talents are remarkable too...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'talentos' for 'skills' fine."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2101dc",
      "back_en": "Thank you for this battle...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2102b0",
      "back_en": "You truly embody the spirit of a mononofu...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21032f",
      "back_en": "With honor.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2103d9",
      "back_en": "You... You did this to him...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x210427",
      "back_en": "You will PAY for what you've done!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate, caps preserved."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21052c",
      "back_en": "be enough to make a scratch on me.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2105bf",
      "back_en": "You... You killed my father!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x21060e",
      "back_en": "run from it. I have chosen a path of carnage.",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'carnagem' non-standard; use 'carnificina/matança'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20ec09",
      "back_en": "Very well... What will be my options?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20ed05",
      "back_en": "Now is the time to persevere...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20eeab",
      "back_en": "Gundhurua finally relents at his determined gaze",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Added 'olhar' completes likely 'determined gaze'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20f69d",
      "back_en": "I promise to kill him without fail!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20f814",
      "back_en": "Haaaaaaaaaah!!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Onomatopoeia equivalent."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20f846",
      "back_en": "Gaaaaaaaaaaaaah!!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Onomatopoeia equivalent."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20fa7f",
      "back_en": "Haaaaaaaaaah!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Onomatopoeia equivalent."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x20fa8d",
      "back_en": "Entua, following the remaining Uzurusha forces",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2103be",
      "back_en": "Entua glares up at Oshtor.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2106d1",
      "back_en": "Entua can do nothing but watch as he departs.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    }
  ],
